<LegalPageLayout
  title="Refund Policy — Landscape Estimate Pro"
  description="Landscape Estimate Pro offers a 7-day, no-questions-asked refund on the one-time Pro purchase."
  h1="Refund Policy"
  updated="September 2026"
>
  <h2>7-day money-back guarantee</h2>
  <p>
    If Landscape Estimate Pro isn't right for you, email us within <strong>7 days of purchase</strong> and we'll
    refund it in full — no questions asked. <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a> with the email address you paid with
    (or your license key) and we'll process the refund back to your original payment method through Dodo Payments,
    our payment processor.
  </p>

  <h2>What happens after a refund</h2>
  <p>
    Once a refund is processed, your license key stops verifying as a succeeded payment and the app will ask you to
    activate again. Any data already saved in your browser's local storage is unaffected — refunding a purchase
    doesn't delete your workspace.
  </p>
</LegalPageLayout>
